      "ogTitle": "Bulgarian National Bank — 20 Leva Híbrido/Polymer (2005)",
      "ogDescription": "Banknote conmemorativo de 20 Leva del Bulgarian National Bank, emitido en 2005 por el 120 aniversario del Lev, en sustrato híbrido de polymer.",
      "template": "<div lang=\"en\" style=\"width:100%; min-height:100vh; background:#0a0a09; font-family:'Cormorant Garamond', serif; box-sizing:border-box;\">\n\n  \n\n  \n\n  <main data-pagefind-meta=\"url:/en/collection/world-polymer/bulgaria-20-leva-2005/\" id=\"main-content\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-screen-label=\"Bulgarian National Bank — 20 Leva (2005)\" style=\"max-width:1180px; margin:0 auto; padding:56px 24px 80px; outline:none;\">\n\n    <a href=\"/en/collection/world-polymer/\" style=\"display:inline-block; color:#e7ddc4; text-decoration:none; font-size:15px; letter-spacing:0.08em; margin-bottom:24px;\">&larr; World polymer banknote catalog</a>\n\n    <div style=\"background:#d8d2cd; border:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.08); border-radius:3px; padding:clamp(28px,4vw,64px); box-shadow:0 30px 70px rgba(0,0,0,0.45);\">\n\n      <div style=\"text-align:center; max-width:760px; margin:0 auto 56px;\">\n        <span style=\"display:block; font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.22em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33; margin-bottom:14px;\">World Polymer Banknotes &middot; Bulgaria</span>\n        <h1 style=\"font-family:'Montenegrin Gothic One', serif; font-weight:400; font-size:clamp(28px,4vw,44px); line-height:1.08; letter-spacing:0.01em; color:#1c1a15; margin:0 0 12px;\">Bulgarian National Bank</h1>\n        <p style=\"font-size:clamp(19px,2vw,23px); font-style:italic; color:#4a4331; margin:0;\">20 Leva &middot; Commemorative Issue, 120th Anniversary of the Bulgarian Lev &middot; 2005</p>\n      </div>\n\n      <div style=\"display:flex; flex-direction:column; align-items:center;\">\n\n        <div style=\"width:100%; max-width:560px; display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:14px; margin:0 auto 48px;\">\n          <button\n            data-zoom-trigger=\"bulgaria-20-leva-2005-hibrido\"\n            aria-label=\"Enlarge image of the banknote\"\n            style=\"all:unset; display:block; width:100%; position:relative; cursor:zoom-in;\"\n          >\n            <picture>\n              <source srcset=\"/uploads/bulgaria-bnb-20-leva-2005-hibrido-polimero.webp\" type=\"image/webp\" />\n              <img\n                src=\"/uploads/bulgaria-bnb-20-leva-2005-hibrido-polimero.jpg\"\n                alt=\"Banknote conmemorativo de 20 Leva del Bulgarian National Bank, obverse arriba con la fachada del edificio del BNB, reverse abajo con la escultura de la duquesa Desislava de la Iglesia de Boyana\"\n                width=\"564\"\n                height=\"621\"\n                loading=\"eager\"\n                decoding=\"async\"\n                style=\"display:block; width:100%; height:auto;\"\n              />\n            </picture>\n            <span style=\"position:absolute; bottom:22px; right:22px; display:flex; align-items:center; gap:8px; background:rgba(10,10,9,0.82); color:#d8d2cd; font-size:13px; letter-spacing:0.08em; padding:8px 14px; border-radius:999px;\">\n              <span style=\"width:6px; height:6px; background:#d8d2cd; transform:rotate(45deg);\"></span>Enlarge</span>\n          </button>\n          <span style=\"font-size:13px; letter-spacing:0.08em; color:#5c4e33; text-align:center; font-style:italic;\">Obverse (top) and reverse (bottom) — Notofilia.com Collection</span>\n<div style=\"display:flex; flex-direction:column;\">\n            <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:200px 1fr; gap:6px 20px; padding:14px 0; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12);\">\n              <span style=\"font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.1em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33;\">Country</span>\n              <span style=\"font-size:19px; color:#221f19;\">Bulgaria</span>\n            </div>\n            <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:200px 1fr; gap:6px 20px; padding:14px 0; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12);\">\n              <span style=\"font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.1em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33;\">Issuing Entity</span>\n              <span style=\"font-size:19px; color:#221f19;\">Българска народна банка (Bulgarian National Bank, BNB)</span>\n            </div>\n            <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:200px 1fr; gap:6px 20px; padding:14px 0; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12);\">\n              <span style=\"font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.1em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33;\">Denomination</span>\n              <span style=\"font-size:19px; color:#221f19;\">Twenty Leva (ДВАДЕСЕТ ЛЕВА)</span>\n            </div>\n            <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:200px 1fr; gap:6px 20px; padding:14px 0; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12);\">\n              <span style=\"font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.1em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33;\">Material</span>\n              <span style=\"font-size:19px; color:#221f19;\">Hybrid substrate &mdash; security paper with an integrated transparent polymer strip; the first Bulgarian banknote to incorporate a plastic composite structure<sup style=\"font-size:12px;\">1</sup></span>\n            </div>\n            <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:200px 1fr; gap:6px 20px; padding:14px 0; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12);\">\n              <span style=\"font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.1em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33;\">Printer</span>\n              <span style=\"font-size:19px; color:#221f19;\">Bulgarian National Bank Printing Works (BNB Printing Works, Sofia)</span>\n            </div>\n            <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:200px 1fr; gap:6px 20px; padding:14px 0; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12);\">\n              <span style=\"font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.1em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33;\">Date of Issue</span>\n              <span style=\"font-size:19px; color:#221f19;\">September 15, 2005, for the 120th anniversary of the Bulgarian Lev and the founding of BNB (1885&ndash;2005)<sup style=\"font-size:12px;\">2</sup></span>\n            </div>\n            <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:200px 1fr; gap:6px 20px; padding:14px 0; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12);\">\n              <span style=\"font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.1em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33;\">Signatories</span>\n              <span style=\"font-size:19px; color:#221f19;\">Ivan Iskrov (Управител / Governor) &middot; Lyubomir Velkov (Главен Касиер / Chief Cashier)</span>\n            </div>\n            <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:200px 1fr; gap:6px 20px; padding:14px 0; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12);\">\n              <span style=\"font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.1em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33;\">Dimensions</span>\n              <span style=\"font-size:19px; color:#221f19;\">134 &times; 74 mm</span>\n            </div>\n            <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:200px 1fr; gap:6px 20px; padding:14px 0; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12); border-bottom:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12);\">\n              <span style=\"font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.1em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33;\">Rarity</span>\n              <span style=\"font-size:19px; color:#221f19;\">Limited-run commemorative issue, sought for combining historic 1885 design with modern security technology</span>\n            </div>\n            <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:200px 1fr; gap:6px 20px; padding:14px 0; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12); border-bottom:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12);\">\n              <span style=\"font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.1em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33;\">Catalog Reference</span>\n              <span style=\"font-size:19px; color:#221f19;\">Pick-121 (P-121a); B230 in<em>The Banknote Book</em><sup style=\"font-size:12px;\">3</sup></span>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n\n        </div>\n\n        <div style=\"width:100%; max-width:760px;\">\n          \n\n          <div style=\"margin-top:44px;\">\n            <h3 style=\"font-size:15px; letter-spacing:0.2em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33; font-weight:600; margin:0 0 14px; font-style:normal;\">Historical and Issue Context</h3>\n            <p style=\"font-size:19px; line-height:1.65; color:#332e22; margin:0 0 12px;\"><strong style=\"color:#1c1a15;\">A tribute to Bulgaria's first banknote:</strong>The reverse is an exact replica of the reverse of the first Bulgarian banknote, the 20 Leva Zlato of 1885, and the obverse imitates the geometric background networks of that original issue, closing the circle between the birth of the Lev and its 120th anniversary.</p>\n            <p style=\"font-size:19px; line-height:1.65; color:#332e22; margin:0;\"><strong style=\"color:#1c1a15;\">A hybrid step toward polymer:</strong>Instead of a full conversion like that in countries like Brunei or Malaysia, the BNB opted to incorporate a strip of transparent polymer on a base of traditional security paper &mdash;a rare hybrid format that served as a test bed for the technology before eventual wider adoption.</p>\n          </div>\n\n          <div style=\"margin-top:36px;\">\n            <h3 style=\"font-size:15px; letter-spacing:0.2em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33; font-weight:600; margin:0 0 14px; font-style:normal;\">Key Details Visible on the Banknote</h3>\n            <ul style=\"list-style:none; margin:0; padding:0; display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:14px;\">\n              <li style=\"display:flex; gap:12px; align-items:baseline;\">\n                <span style=\"width:6px; height:6px; min-width:6px; background:#5c4e33; transform:rotate(45deg); position:relative; top:-3px;\"></span>\n                <span style=\"font-size:19px; line-height:1.6; color:#332e22;\"><strong style=\"color:#1c1a15;\">Obverse:</strong>Elements of the historic facade of the Bulgarian National Bank building, the official emblem of the bank and multicolored geometric background networks in the style of the first Bulgarian banknotes of 1885.</span>\n              </li>\n              <li style=\"display:flex; gap:12px; align-items:baseline;\">\n                <span style=\"width:6px; height:6px; min-width:6px; background:#5c4e33; transform:rotate(45deg); position:relative; top:-3px;\"></span>\n                <span style=\"font-size:19px; line-height:1.6; color:#332e22;\"><strong style=\"color:#1c1a15;\">Reverse:</strong>replica of the reverse of the original 1885 20 Leva Zlato banknote, with a detailed reproduction of the seated sculpture of Duchess Sevastokratoritsa Desislava from Boyana Church.</span>\n              </li>\n              <li style=\"display:flex; gap:12px; align-items:baseline;\">\n                <span style=\"width:6px; height:6px; min-width:6px; background:#5c4e33; transform:rotate(45deg); position:relative; top:-3px;\"></span>\n                <span style=\"font-size:19px; line-height:1.6; color:#332e22;\"><strong style=\"color:#1c1a15;\">Polymer strip:</strong>Transparent plastic vertical band integrated into the left side of the hybrid substrate, with complex optical effects when illuminated.</span>\n              </li>\n              <li style=\"display:flex; gap:12px; align-items:baseline;\">\n                <span style=\"width:6px; height:6px; min-width:6px; background:#5c4e33; transform:rotate(45deg); position:relative; top:-3px;\"></span>\n                <span style=\"font-size:19px; line-height:1.6; color:#332e22;\"><strong style=\"color:#1c1a15;\">OVD metal shield:</strong>three-dimensional glossy patch with the &ldquo;БНБ&rdquo; logo and the number &ldquo;20&rdquo;, which changes color depending on the angle of the light.</span>\n              </li>\n              <li style=\"display:flex; gap:12px; align-items:baseline;\">\n                <span style=\"width:6px; height:6px; min-width:6px; background:#5c4e33; transform:rotate(45deg); position:relative; top:-3px;\"></span>\n                <span style=\"font-size:19px; line-height:1.6; color:#332e22;\"><strong style=\"color:#1c1a15;\">Commemorative microprint:</strong>continuous microtext &ldquo;120 ГОДИНИ БЪЛГАРСКА ЛЕВА&rdquo; (120 Years of the Bulgarian Lev) in the security background.</span>\n              </li>\n              <li style=\"display:flex; gap:12px; align-items:baseline;\">\n                <span style=\"width:6px; height:6px; min-width:6px; background:#5c4e33; transform:rotate(45deg); position:relative; top:-3px;\"></span>\n                <span style=\"font-size:19px; line-height:1.6; color:#332e22;\"><strong style=\"color:#1c1a15;\">Perfect registration:</strong>The stylized numeral &ldquo;20&rdquo; is precisely completed when both sides overlap.</span>\n              </li>\n              <li style=\"display:flex; gap:12px; align-items:baseline;\">\n                <span style=\"width:6px; height:6px; min-width:6px; background:#5c4e33; transform:rotate(45deg); position:relative; top:-3px;\"></span>\n                <span style=\"font-size:19px; line-height:1.6; color:#332e22;\"><strong style=\"color:#1c1a15;\">Dual Numbering:</strong>double serial number in black ink (&ldquo;AA 0054111&rdquo;) &mdash;a standard upper right horizontal block and another lower left, smaller size and different symmetrical axis, for accounting control.</span>\n              </li>\n              <li style=\"display:flex; gap:12px; align-items:baseline;\">\n                <span style=\"width:6px; height:6px; min-width:6px; background:#5c4e33; transform:rotate(45deg); position:relative; top:-3px;\"></span>\n                <span style=\"font-size:19px; line-height:1.6; color:#332e22;\"><strong style=\"color:#1c1a15;\">Color:</strong>violet, purple and multicolored blue/ocher undertones.</span>\n              </li>\n            </ul>\n          </div>\n\n          <div style=\"margin-top:44px; padding-top:20px; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12);\">\n            <h3 style=\"font-size:13px; letter-spacing:0.14em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33; font-weight:600; margin:0 0 10px; font-style:normal;\">Notes</h3>\n            <p style=\"font-size:14px; line-height:1.6; color:#5c4e33; margin:0 0 6px;\">1. Numista, &ldquo;Bulgaria P#121&rdquo;,<em>en.numista.com/catalogue/note202309.html</em>: listed as a hybrid substrate banknote with polymer stripe, the first in Bulgaria to incorporate this material.</p>\n            <p style=\"font-size:14px; line-height:1.6; color:#5c4e33; margin:0 0 6px;\">2. Banknote World, &ldquo;Bulgaria 20 Leva Banknote, 2005, P-121&rdquo;: issued on September 15, 2005 to commemorate the 120&deg; anniversary of the issuance of the Bulgarian Lev.</p>\n            <p style=\"font-size:14px; line-height:1.6; color:#5c4e33; margin:0;\">3. Catalog cross-reference: Pick n.&deg; 121 (Standard Catalog of World Paper Money) and B230 (The Banknote Book, Owen Linzmayer).</p>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </main>\n\n  \n    <div\n      role=\"dialog\"\n      aria-modal=\"true\"\n      aria-label=\"Enlarged banknote\"\n     \n     data-zoom-dialog=\"note-1\" hidden class=\"catalog-zoom-dialog\">\n      <button\n        data-zoom-close\n        aria-label=\"Close\"\n        style=\"position:absolute; top:24px; right:28px; background:transparent; border:1px solid rgba(231,222,201,0.4); color:#d8d2cd; font-size:22px; line-height:1; width:44px; height:44px; border-radius:50%; cursor:pointer;\"\n      >&times;</button>\n\n      <div style=\"position:absolute; top:24px; left:28px; display:flex; align-items:center; gap:6px; background:rgba(10,10,9,0.5); border:1px solid rgba(231,222,201,0.25); border-radius:999px; padding:6px;\">\n        <button\n          disabled=\"true\"\n          aria-label=\"Zoom out\"\n          style=\"width:38px; height:38px; border-radius:50%; border:none; background:transparent; color:#d8d2cd; font-size:20px; cursor:pointer;\"\n        >&minus;</button>\n        <span style=\"min-width:56px; text-align:center; font-size:14px; color:#e7ddc4; letter-spacing:0.05em;\">100%</span>\n        <button\n          disabled=\"false\"\n          aria-label=\"Zoom in\"\n          style=\"width:38px; height:38px; border-radius:50%; border:none; background:transparent; color:#d8d2cd; font-size:20px; cursor:pointer;\"\n        >&#43;</button>\n      </div>\n\n      <div\n        style=\"overflow:hidden; max-width:92vw; max-height:74vh; touch-action:none;\"\n      >\n        <picture>\n          <source srcset=\"/uploads/bulgaria-bnb-20-leva-2005-hibrido-polimero.webp\" type=\"image/webp\" />\n          <img\n            src=\"/uploads/bulgaria-bnb-20-leva-2005-hibrido-polimero.jpg\"\n            alt=\"Banknote of Bulgaria, enlarged view\"\n            draggable=\"false\"\n            style=\"display:block; max-width:92vw; max-height:74vh; width:auto; height:auto; transform:; cursor:zoom-in; user-select:none;\"\n          />\n        </picture>\n      </div>\n\n      <span style=\"margin-top:18px; font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.06em; color:#b7ab8a; font-style:italic;\">Drag to move &middot; Mouse wheel to zoom</span>\n    </div>\n  \n\n  \n\n</div>",
      "recordTitle": "Bulgarian National Bank",
      "eyebrow": "World Polymer Banknotes · Bulgaria"
    }
